{"id":"wb-8-372","name":"偃师九龙庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"偃师九龙庙","text":"偃师九龙庙位于中国河南省洛阳市偃师区山化镇石家庄村南，临伊洛河而建，是当地船工祭祀治水人物黄守才、祈求航运平安的庙宇。庙内建筑包括正殿、后殿、钟楼、鼓楼及两侧附属房屋，雕刻和彩绘中有黄守才治水的题材。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%81%83%E5%B8%88%E4%B9%9D%E9%BE%99%E5%BA%99","revisionId":95428676,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95428676","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e50e14a161b5928f1935ad32.jpg","title":"20240815_Jiulong_Temple_in_Yanshi_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20240815_Jiulong_Temple_in_Yanshi_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/20240815_Jiulong_Temple_in_Yanshi_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​偃师九龙庙","width":320,"height":213}}